        "domain": "Exactly the three explicitly licensed PrototypeKind constants FIRE, WATER, CRYSTAL. No overloaded ot or default result type.",
        "output_invariant": "All three compounds are the same comparison-head function type. After both operands they always return ComparisonRecord. None becomes a RespectSet, Subject or free adjective because its position is inconvenient."
